@MarketeersInsuranceDescribe_Chimata(ARG)
SELECTCASE ARG
CASE 0
    PRINTFORML Do you want to cancel your plan?
    PRINTFORML Your benefits will end *immediately* if you do.
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML By canceling your plan, you will:
    PRINTFORML - No longer be able to receive treatment from our medics 
    IF HealthInsuranceLevel >= 2
        PRINTFORML - Not be recovered on fainting or death
        PRINTFORML - Have to pay full price for services in Eienitei 
        IF HealthInsuranceLevel >= 3
            PRINTFORML - Lose access to our autoinjectors
            IF HealthInsuranceLevel >= 4
                PRINTFORML  - This will affect everyone in your plan.
            ENDIF

        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML Do you really want to cancel?
CASE 1
    PRINTFORML As accommodating for low income families, the Wooden plan is the budget insurance plan.
    PRINTFORML With the Wooden plan, you get basic access to our medical services.
    PRINTFORML You can call in our specialized combat medical team at any time to receive treatment if needed.
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML This comes with some serious limitations however.
    PRINTFORML The medics must be deployed in your area if you faint in order to get treatment.
    PRINTFORML The on-spot fee is 15000 yen, but the recovery fee is 40000 yen.
    PRINTFORML And there is no coverage against mortality.
CASE 2
    PRINTFORML The Stone plan is the moderately-priced plan that most opt for, especially in the chaotic state of Gensokyo.
    PRINTFORML With our higher level subscription, you get cheaper healing and recovery, as well as mortality coverage.
    PRINTFORML And most importantly: Automatic recovery.
    PRINTFORML Once you unexpectedly faint or lose pulse, we will automatically send in our medic team to help recover you.
    PRINTFORML You don't have to call use beforehand.
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML Like the Wooden plan, you can call the medics for healing if needed.
    PRINTFORML The on-spot fee is 7500 yen, the recovery fee is 18000 yen, and the resurrection fee is 40000 yen.
    PRINTFORML Eienitei services and our Pharmacy are discounted by 30\%.
CASE 3
    PRINTFORML Iron is where those that live life on the edge go for.
    PRINTFORML With a supplied autoinjector, you can bring yourself or one you dear love from the brink of death back to tip top condition.
    PRINTFORML We'll send you a new one the next day on use, so don't be afraid to use it.
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML As well, we will cover all costs when it comes to healing, recovery, and resurrection
    PRINTFORML Like in Stone, recovery services are automatically called on fainting or death.
    PRINTFORML Also, all Eienitei services and our Pharmacy are discounted by 65\%.
CASE 4
    PRINTFORML As the family plain of Marketeers, Diamond serves not just you, but the people alongside you too.
    PRINTFORML Anyone that has fallen for you can access our services with just your account.
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML Automatic recovery? Autoinjectors? Free healing? They all get it.
    PRINTFORML To sweeten the deal, we're also giving out an 80\% discount on all Eienitei services and our Pharmacy with our Diamond plan
ENDSELECT



